OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'baffled' after pub refuses
OL,4,Aentry over poppy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has said he was left "baffled"
OL,7,Fafter a pub refused him entry because
OL,8,Fhe was wearing a poppy.
OL,10,FVeteran Scott Schillemore, from
OL,11,FPortsmouth, said staff at The Star in
OL,12,FGosport told him anything that could be
OL,13,Finterpreted as "a political statement"
OL,14,Fwas not allowed.
OL,16,FIt came as about 400 anti-migrant
OL,17,Fprotesters staged a march, which
OL,18,FSchillemore said he had not attended,
OL,19,Fthrough the town.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
