OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'baffled' after pub refuses
OL,4,Aentry over poppy
OL,5,
OL,6,FWetherspoons, which owns the pub, said
OL,7,Fsome members of the public had not been
OL,8,Fallowed in the pub due to "security
OL,9,Fmeasures" following "demonstrations in
OL,10,Fthe town".
